<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft gets US$4.5 million contract.</title>
<headline>Datacraft gets US$4.5 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Systems integrator Datacraft Asia said on Wednesday it has won a US$4.5 million contract to provide a nationwide Internet backbone in Malaysia.</p>
<p>In addition, it will also provide support services for the entire network nationwide, it said.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080 ds rdp</p>
</text>
